- mirror the release files on another download page, or offer them as part of a paid bundle.

## Third-party components

MitzuVPN is built on and with open-source projects — among them Xray-core, 3x-ui, WireGuard,
AmneziaWG, OpenVPN and Psiphon. Those components remain under their own licences; the app lists every
one of them under **Settings → About → Open-source licences**.

Names and logos of third parties belong to their owners. Nothing in this file grants a trademark
